                <pb facs="0349" n="261" sameAs="frus:frus1933v05/pg261"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.51/1738: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dawson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-11-16T16:00:00-05:00">November 16, 1933—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:25 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>91. My 90, November 14, 1 p.m. Sessions of Congress extended to November 21st by
                    Executive decree. House has begun debate on debt bill.</p>
                <p>Olaya has put off seeing me. It seems very evident he does not wish to discuss
                    matter.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
